# Testing

- Prefer pytest.
- Test behavior, not implementation trivia.
- Do not add tests only to raise coverage numbers.

## Cover when relevant

- Normal cases
- Edge cases
- Invalid input
- Empty / missing data
- Statistical calculations
- Tool schemas
- Agent routing

## Placement

- Skill / agent unit tests: colocated `tests/` under the component
- Integration / API / cross-cutting: `tests/` at repo root

## Rules

- No real network in unit tests (mock external APIs).
- No secrets in fixtures.
- Synthetic data fixtures must be labelled as synthetic.
- Ask before running the full test suite (see `AGENTS.md`).

